WEBVTT

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:31.704
I like how the rest of you are like, 
“Oh look, you made it out.

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:32.704
Aw.”

00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:34.662
(Laughs)

00:00:34.871 --> 00:00:38.162
Everybody in New York is getting
a little too uptight, anyway, for me.

00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:40.162
It doesn’t matter
what you say in New York,

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:41.954
somebody will get upset at something.

00:00:41.954 --> 00:00:43.037
That’s just how it is.

00:00:43.037 --> 00:00:45.621
I could do a knock-knock joke
and someone will be like,

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:46.746
“I never had a door.”

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.871
(Laughter)

00:00:50.246 --> 00:00:52.162
We need that little bit of release.

00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:56.871
We need that salvation within comedy.

00:00:57.121 --> 00:00:58.704
That’s why I like to travel, too.

00:00:58.704 --> 00:00:59.954
I like to meet new people.

00:00:59.954 --> 00:01:01.579
I like to go to different places.